# The meshing tutorial (user request 2026-11-13: "an individual tutorial (separate from the 1st install tutorial) of how to
# mesh parts, what makes a good mesh, and a couple of examples to go through; for the 1st launch, attach it to the back end
# of the beginning walkthrough"): the tour as on the first start hands on to it at its end; the ideas; each example case
# made by its button and walked through the STL mesher's steps; the duct and the sphere meshed with Try it; the airfoil
# made; the end.
budget p95 80 max 3000
action help.tourfull
wait 10
assert widget tour-card
click tour-next
wait 8
click tour-next
wait 8
click tour-next
wait 8
click tour-next
wait 8
click tour-practice
wait-until case-open timeout 20
wait 8
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
click tour-next
wait 6
assert text On to the meshing tutorial
screenshot $OUT/m00_handoff.png
click tour-next
wait 10
assert text Start the tutorial
screenshot $OUT/m01.png
click tour-next
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m02.png
click tour-next
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m03.png
click tour-next
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m04.png
click tour-next
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m05.png
click tour-next
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m06.png
click tour-next
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m07.png
click tour-next
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m08.png
assert widget tour-example
click tour-example
wait-until case-open timeout 20
wait 20
assert log mesher/mesher.ini domain = internal
screenshot $OUT/m09_geometry.png
click tour-next
wait 15
screenshot $OUT/m10_flow.png
click tour-next
wait 15
screenshot $OUT/m11_boundaries.png
click tour-next
wait 15
screenshot $OUT/m12_settings.png
click tour-next
wait 15
screenshot $OUT/m13_generate.png
click tour-try
wait 5
click stl-gen
wait-until job running timeout 20
wait-until job finished timeout 600
assert log log.checkMesh Mesh OK.
click tour-resume
wait 10
click tour-next
wait 20
screenshot $OUT/m14_quality.png
click tour-next
wait 10
assert widget tour-example
click tour-example
wait-until case-open timeout 20
wait 20
assert log mesher/mesher.ini domain = external
screenshot $OUT/m16_tunnel.png
click tour-next
wait 15
screenshot $OUT/m17_wake.png
click tour-next
wait 15
click tour-try
wait 5
click stl-gen
wait-until job running timeout 20
wait-until job finished timeout 600
assert log log.checkMesh Mesh OK.
click tour-resume
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m18_sphere_generated.png
click tour-next
wait 10
assert widget tour-example
click tour-example
wait-until case-open timeout 20
wait 20
assert log mesher/mesher.ini two_d = 1
screenshot $OUT/m20_2d.png
click tour-next
wait 15
screenshot $OUT/m21_layers.png
click tour-next
wait 15
screenshot $OUT/m22_generate.png
click tour-next
wait 15
screenshot $OUT/m23_every.png
click tour-next
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/m24_list.png
click tour-next
wait 10
assert not widget tour-card
# on its own (Settings > Help > Meshing tutorial, the palette): it opens at its start and Skip ends it
action help.meshtour
wait 10
assert widget tour-card
assert text Skip the tutorial
click tour-skip2
wait 5
assert not widget tour-card
